meta {
  name: Read a booking document
  type: http
  seq: 68
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/documents/{{documentId}}/extract
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
}

docs {
  201 with an `ai_actions` proposal (tool `extract_booking`, no conversation):
  the event the booking stands for, its legs and the document link, plus the
  draft and the fields to review. Nothing is written until it is accepted
  (`POST …/ai/actions/:id/accept`). A PDF's text goes to the text model; a
  scan or a photo goes to `LLM_VISION_MODEL`. 503 E_EXTRACTION_UNAVAILABLE
  without one, 402 over the token cap, 429 throttled, 422 E_LLM_BAD_OUTPUT,
  404 for a document of another trip, 409 E_DOCUMENT_ALREADY_LINKED for a
  document already attached to an event, 415 for a PDF that cannot be
  opened, 413 for a PDF over 10 MB or one whose parse is cut off.
}
